  displayName: Rack
  summary: 'Passive storage: a fixed set of shelves or cells with no robot of its
    own. Parts are placed and removed by an operator or by the robot of a neighbouring
    station.'
  details: "Nothing moves the stock automatically \u2014 the rack is only the storage;
    an operator or a neighbouring robot is the handling system. Parts sit in templates
    in its cells, which are tracked by address just like ASRS cells."
